{"id":"dass","lemma":"dass","pos":"conj","rank":21,"glosses":["that","so that"],"ipa":"/das/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/74/De-dass.ogg/De-dass.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wir wollen, dass du das tust.","en":"We want you to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760369","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"}]},{"text":"Du weißt, dass ich dich mag.","en":"You know that I like you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695694","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"}]},{"text":"Weiß er, dass du ihn liebst?","en":"Does he know that you love him?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695457","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"to love","l":"lieben"}]},{"text":"Wie kommt es, dass Sie fragen?","en":"How come you ask?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/215674","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to ask"}]},{"text":"Ich weiß, dass du es hast.","en":"I know you have it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695668","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]}]}